WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.901
Ooh! I think Mom was right.

2
00:00:10.902 --> 00:00:14.958
I ate too much!

3
00:00:14.959 --> 00:00:17.561
Mom: What's wrong, Hana?

4
00:00:17.562 --> 00:00:20.599
Hana: I'm not feeling well, Mommy.

5
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.999
Mom: Where do you feel sick?

6
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.383
Hana: My stomach hurts.

7
00:00:27.384 --> 00:00:30.834
Mom: I thought you ate too much yesterday.

8
00:00:30.835 --> 00:00:35.583
Hana: I know, Mommy. I'm sorry.

9
00:00:35.584 --> 00:00:37.740
Sunny: There you are, Young-hee.

10
00:00:37.741 --> 00:00:40.007
Bada isn't feeling well.

11
00:00:40.008 --> 00:00:43.188
Mom: Neither is Hana.

12
00:00:43.189 --> 00:00:45.473
Sunny: How are you feeling?

13
00:00:45.474 --> 00:00:47.713
Hana: I have a stomachache.

14
00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:49.451
How is Bada?

15
00:00:49.452 --> 00:00:52.521
Sunny: He has a runny nose and a cough.

16
00:00:52.522 --> 00:00:58.483
Hana: Poor Bada! I hope he's better soon.

17
00:00:58.484 --> 00:01:01.007
Sunny: I'd better go to the drugstore.

18
00:01:01.008 --> 00:01:03.988
Sunny: l'll get some medicine for you and Bada.

19
00:01:03.989 --> 00:01:05.798
Hana: Thank you.

20
00:01:05.799 --> 00:01:10.195
Mom: My poor baby.

21
00:01:10.196 --> 00:01:14.236
Sunny: Here, take this. Ahh . . .

22
00:01:14.237 --> 00:01:18.535
Hana: Yuck! It tastes awful!

23
00:01:18.536 --> 00:01:22.025
Sunny: You have to take this three times a day.

24
00:01:22.026 --> 00:01:26.663
Hana: I wish I wasn't sick.

25
00:01:26.664 --> 00:01:29.822
Sunny: Hey, Bada! How are you feeling?

26
00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:32.070
Bada: I'm hungry!

27
00:01:32.071 --> 00:01:34.705
Sunny: How about some chocolate ice cream?

28
00:01:34.706 --> 00:01:41.518
Hana: Not for me!

29
00:01:41.519 --> 00:01:45.299
Bada and I are feeling much better now.

30
00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:51.855
I'll never eat so much ice cream again!
